   "lines": [
    "I remember so",
    "well all his",
    "dear little peculiarities",
    "and originalities;",
    "his \"warlike curl\"",
    "that never would",
    "stay brushed, the",
    "quick way he",
    "would dress,",
    "and all his other",
    "traits. I do",
    "not think I",
    "shall ever",
    "realize he is",
    "really gone.",
    "I love all the",
    "rest of the",
    "family especial-"
   ],
   "rows": null,
